      "label": "Interactive",
      "description": "",
      "code": "import { ScrollArea } from '@refy-design/web';\nfunction ScrollAreaExample() {\n  return (\n    <ScrollArea role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable materials\" maxHeight={180}>\n      <ul>\n        {Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => (\n          <li key={i} style={{ paddingBlock: 10 }}>\n            Reference material {i + 1}\n          </li>\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n    </ScrollArea>\n  );\n}\nexport function Example() {\n  return <ScrollAreaExample />;\n}"
